[step] Required graphic relief, the rear nameplate's construction: the frame, mark, rule, light ring and ON rise above the black face over their embedded colour volume. The parallel planes are the face and the artwork's top.
alternatives: Flush inlay removes the raised edge the nameplate's style carries; a taller rise adds a heavier edge to the same graphic.
