[sliver] Required graphic outlines, as on the nameplate: these strips are the raised sides of the frame and light ring and the rule's front, at the nameplate's frame weight. They define the fine frame and rule rather than an incidental junction between mechanical features.
alternatives: Wider strokes change the nameplate's light border. Removing the raised side faces requires flush artwork.
